@startuml measurement_service
title Тёплый дом — C4 Code: компонент MeasurementService (Python MVP)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

class MeasurementService {
  - repository: MeasurementStore
  - source: TemperatureGateway
  + capture(device: dict): Measurement
  + accept(measurement: Measurement, device: dict): Measurement
}
interface MeasurementStore <<Protocol>> {
  + save(measurement: Measurement): Measurement
  + history(device_id: int, limit: int): list[Measurement]
  + ping(): None
}
class MeasurementRepository {
  - database_url: str
  + save(measurement: Measurement): Measurement
  + history(device_id: int, limit: int): list[Measurement]
  + ping(): None
}
class TemperatureGateway {
  - client: httpx.Client
  - base_url: str
  + read(device: dict): Reading
}
class Reading <<Pydantic model>> {
  + value: float
  + unit: str
  + timestamp: AwareDatetime
  + location: str
  + status: str
  + sensor_id: str
  + sensor_type: str
  + description: str
}
class Measurement <<Pydantic model>> {
  + id: UUID
  + device_id: int
  + home_id: int
}
class Collector {
  - devices: DeviceGateway
  - measurements: MeasurementService
  + collect(): None
}
class DeviceGateway {
  + get(device_id: int): dict
  + list_temperature_devices(): list[dict]
}

MeasurementService --> MeasurementStore : сохраняет
MeasurementRepository ..|> MeasurementStore
MeasurementService --> TemperatureGateway : получает показание
TemperatureGateway ..> Reading : создаёт
MeasurementService ..> Measurement : создаёт / проверяет
Reading <|-- Measurement
Collector --> MeasurementService : capture
Collector --> DeviceGateway : реестр
@enduml
